### unquoted glob after execdir
find . -type d -execdir rm *.orig \;
>>> SC2014 1:28
>>> SC2035 1:28

### command substitution after exec
find . -name '*.gz' -exec cp {} /backup/$(date +%F) \;
>>> SC2014 1:41
>>> SC2046 1:41

### glob before the exec action is fine
find ./*.c -exec gzip {} \;
>>> none

### quoted glob after exec is fine
find . -type d -execdir rm '*.orig' \;
>>> none
